00:14:56,842 --> 00:15:02,842
Cabrini is a history, drama film directed by Alejandro Monteverde.

3
00:22:25,263 --> 00:22:31,263
Italian immigrant Francesca Cabrini arrives in 1889 New York City and is
greeted by disease, crime, and impoverished children.

4
00:29:53,684 --> 00:29:59,684
Cabrini sets off on a daring mission to convince the hostile mayor to
secure housing and healthcare for society's most vulnerable.

5
00:37:22,105 --> 00:37:28,105
With broken English and poor health, Cabrini uses her entrepreneurial mind to
build an empire of hope unlike anything the world had ever seen.

6
