12
01:29:41,052 --> 01:29:47,052
Cabrini is a 2024 American biographical drama film directed by Alejandro Gómez
Monteverde and written by Rod Barr, based on a story by both.

13
01:37:09,473 --> 01:37:15,473
The film depicts the life of Catholic missionary Francesca Cabrini, portrayed by Cristiana Dell'Anna,
as she encounters resistance to her charity and business efforts in New York City.

14
01:44:37,894 --> 01:44:43,894
Cabrini explores the sexism and anti-Italian bigotry faced by Cabrini
and others in New York City in the late 19th century.

15
01:52:06,315 --> 01:52:12,315
Cabrini was released in the United States on March 8, 2024, by Angel Studios.

16
01:59:34,736 --> 01:59:40,736
The film received mostly positive reviews, yet became a box-office bomb,
grossing $20.6 million worldwide on a $50 million budget.

17
02:07:03,157 --> 02:07:09,157
The film explores themes of new york city, immigrant,
based on true story, 19th century, somber.

18
02:14:31,578 --> 02:14:37,578
The tone is uplifting and emotional.
